    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17101" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτῐτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unavenged,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.414
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unpaid,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποινή</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				14.484
			</span></i> [where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span>].
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>not liable to penalty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				4.498
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Mycenae</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίω</span>)
				<i>unhonoured,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Menecr.Xanth.
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
